# The Boulder, Ready to Rumble {3}{G}: "Whenever The Boulder attacks, earthbend X, where X is the number of creatures you control with
# power 4 or greater." On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with The Boulder (4/4) beside its own Alpine Grizzly (4/2, summoning sick but counted) while Bot2
# controls an Alpine Grizzly too (not counted, "you control"): X = 2, so the chosen Forest becomes a 2/2 haste land creature (CR 701.66a, 107.3).

